== resolution
show slim neutral left
slim: Loader's linked. Rustlers are somebody else's problem now - or nobody's.
choice
    "Report the relay point to the Company." -> ending_company
    "Let it go. Say the trail went cold." -> ending_mercy
    "Copy what they were reaching for, before the log clears." -> ending_defect [if rustler_sympathy >= 1]

== ending_company
> The report goes out clean, coordinates and all. The Company will send someone with less patience than Slim had.
show slim tired left
# kept: script.rpy:637
slim: No rest for the weary. What's causing all these failures lately?
show clipi text1 center
# kept: script.rpy:640
clipi: Insufficient data... but patterns suggest coordinated activity.
show slim normal left
# kept: script.rpy:643
slim: Something bigger is happening on Syntax-4. And I've got a feeling we're going to be right in the middle of it.

== ending_mercy
> The report Slim files says the trail went cold at the relay point. It isn't true. It's close enough to true that the Company doesn't ask twice.
show clipi talk center
clipi: You know they'll be back.
show slim neutral left
slim: So will I.

== ending_defect
> The copy is small - a few kilobytes of whatever the rustlers wanted badly enough to risk a channel this exposed. Slim doesn't read it before burying it in the field log, unindexed.
show clipi glitch center
clipi: That's not in any report I'm filing.
show slim talk left
slim: Wasn't asking you to.

== ending_escaped
show slim frown left
> The loader runs. The rustler doesn't answer a second hail. Whatever left with them, it isn't coming back on this channel.
show clipi glitch center
clipi: Insufficient data.
show slim tired left
slim: Story of the week.

